{"id": 1008035, "slug": "squareman-boy", "name": "SquareMan-Boy", "name_original": "SquareMan-Boy", "description": "<p><strong>SquareMan-Boy</strong> is a fast paced action platformer with focus on quick and precise movement. </p><p>You're always in motion, bounced between color-coded blocks, dodging lasers, and racing to the exit. Use your charge dash, world rotators, and teleporters to bend each level to your will. Every second counts!</p><p><strong>Each level has an exit and your goal is to reach it without dying</strong> </p><p><strong>Press and hold to charge a dash, release the button to charge away with great speed</strong> </p><p><strong>World rotators will always rotate the level 90 degrees clockwise</strong> </p><p><strong>Teleporters will let you travel unharmed to its same colored twin</strong> </p><p>And more...</p><p> </p><h3>Features</h3><ul><li><p>Leaderboards for quickest times on each level</p><ul><li><p>Global or between steam friends</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Fast paced action with responsive controls</p></li><li><p>Over 100+ handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p>Large amount of bite-sized levels</p></li><li><p> Neon style graphics and effects</p></li><li><p>Synthwave sounds track</p></li><li><p>Full controller support </p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-08-01", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-08-04T11:01:58", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/a14/a14fbcd8d1bbb703cd67c0b5f56f6d66.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/01d/01d911f7f71b8875b686eacfdd4246f7.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count